From: Ryder Lee <ryder.lee@mediatek.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Oct 2023 12:06:48 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: mt76: mt7915: fix missing CH144 support for pre-calibration

Sync from MTK SDK. The MT7915 pre-calibration data has no
CH144@BW20 slot, so the DPD frequency lookup fails and channel 144
comes up without DPD applied. Fall back to the adjacent channel's
data at 5700 MHz instead.

[chad: apply the remap after the adjacent-centre search so wide
bandwidth lookups are unaffected]

Fixes: 495184ac91bb ("mt76: mt7915: add support for applying pre-calibration data")
Fixes: OWRT-8413

Signed-off-by: Chad Monroe <chad@monroe.io>
---
 mt7915/mcu.c |    3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

--- a/mt7915/mcu.c
+++ b/mt7915/mcu.c
@@ -3187,6 +3187,9 @@ static int mt7915_dpd_freq_idx(struct mt
 			return idx;
 	}
 
+	if (is_mt7915(&dev->mt76))
+		freq = (freq == 5720) ? 5700: freq;
+
 	return mt7915_find_freq_idx(freq_list, n_freqs, freq);
 }
 
